    narr:narration """This voice profile gathers one speaker's review comments from a single session, all dated the same day. The arc runs from [questioning how soak duration is validated](narr:Expr_20260929_1_ReviewCommentsTinaTeammember20260924_h1feabda3f4e2_3) through [naming the cost of the correction](narr:Expr_20260929_1_ReviewCommentsTinaTeammember20260924_h1feabda3f4e2_4) to [owning the earlier error outright](narr:Expr_20260929_1_ReviewCommentsTinaTeammember20260924_h1feabda3f4e2_8) and [putting the supersession on the record](narr:Expr_20260929_1_ReviewCommentsTinaTeammember20260924_h1feabda3f4e2_7). The register is antithesis-first — the sentence names what it isn't — with a formal, anaphora-heavy turn when retracting.""" ;
    narr:reaction """First digest for this hub, so there is no prior narration to diff — the profile is newly written from the session's arc: question, cost-naming, acceptance, retraction, record-setting. The load-bearing tension is that the speaker both endorses the correction and demands its tightness be recorded.""" ;
